##  Project Overview

The **AI Workplace Productivity Assistant** is a modern, full-featured React-based web application designed to help professionals automate daily workplace tasks using artificial intelligence. Built as a single integrated platform, it provides multiple AI-powered tools within a clean, intuitive dashboard interface.

###  Purpose

This application demonstrates the practical implementation of AI tools in a professional workplace setting, showcasing:

- Real-world problem solving through AI integration
- Advanced prompt engineering techniques
- Modern UI/UX design principles
- Responsible AI usage and ethical considerations
- Scalable React architecture with Tailwind CSS

###  Key Differentiators

- **Single Platform:** All tools integrated into one dashboard
- **Modern Tech Stack:** React 18 + Tailwind CSS + Framer Motion
- **Responsive Design:** Mobile-first approach with dark mode
- **Editable Outputs:** All AI-generated content can be refined
- **Professional UI:** SaaS-grade design with smooth animations

---

## Features

###  Dashboard

- Summary statistics cards showing usage metrics
- Quick access buttons to all modules
- Recent activity feed
- System status indicators

###  Core Modules (All 5 Implemented)

#### 1.  Smart Email Generator

- Generate professional emails in multiple tones
- Support for: Formal, Friendly, Persuasive, Professional, Casual
- Editable outputs with copy/regenerate functionality
- Subject line suggestions and recipient personalization
- Character count and tone indicators
- Email preview with formatting

#### 2. Meeting Notes Summarizer

- AI-powered summarization of meeting transcripts
- Extract: Executive summary, key decisions, action items, deadlines
- Export summaries in multiple formats (PDF, Text)
- Edit and refine generated content
- Meeting metadata (date, duration, attendees)
- Action item tracking

#### 3.  AI Task Planner / Scheduler

- Intelligent task prioritization and scheduling
- Daily, weekly, and monthly planning views
- Priority-based task ordering (High, Medium, Low)
- Progress tracking with visual indicators
- Export schedules to PDF/print
- Drag-and-drop task management
- Time-blocking recommendations

#### 4. AI Research Assistant

- Topic/article summarization and analysis
- Key insights and actionable recommendations
- Research depth options (Brief, Detailed, Comprehensive)
- Save and export research findings
- Citation and reference support
- Related topics discovery

#### 5. AI Chatbot Interface

- Interactive workplace assistant
- Context-aware conversations
- Quick suggestion chips for common queries
- Chat history and export functionality
- Keyboard shortcuts for power users
- Markdown support in responses

